  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9876f83510731f4d97169c0d46b0606, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lucifer Greetings - DialogueLine 26
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: ' How do you feel about all this chaos?'
    portugueseLine: " Como voc\xEA se sente sobre todo esse caos?"
    chineseLine: "\u4F60\u5BF9\u8FD9\u4E00\u5207\u6DF7\u4E71\u611F\u89C9\u5982\u4F55?  "
    spanishLine: " \xBFC\xF3mo te sientes sobre todo este caos?"
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: " Like someone who has already lived chaos. It\u2019s an interesting
      company...  but tiring."
    portugueseLine: "Como algu\xE9m que j\xE1 viveu o caos. \xC9 uma companhia interessante...
      mas cansativa."
    chineseLine: "\u5C31\u50CF\u4E00\u4E2A\u5DF2\u7ECF\u4EB2\u5386\u6DF7\u6C8C\u7684\u4EBA\u3002\u8FD9\u662F\u4E2A\u6709\u8DA3\u7684\u4F19\u4F34...
      \u4F46\u8BA9\u4EBA\u75B2\u60EB\u3002"
    spanishLine: " Como alguien que ya vivi\xF3 el caos. Es una compa\xF1\xEDa interesante... 
      pero fatigante."
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: ' I know how it is...  This is like Hell, but without the good parties.'
    portugueseLine: " Sei como \xE9... Isso \xE9 como um inferno, mas sem as boas
      festas."
    chineseLine: "\u6211\u77E5\u9053... \u8FD9\u50CF\u662F\u5730\u72F1\uFF0C\u5374\u6CA1\u6709\u597D\u6D3E\u5BF9\u3002"
    spanishLine: " S\xE9 c\xF3mo es...  Esto es como el Infierno, pero sin las buenas
      fiestas."
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: " Exactly. The party\u2019s been over for a long time."
    portugueseLine: "Exatamente. A festa acabou h\xE1 muito tempo."
    chineseLine: "\u6CA1\u9519\u3002\u6D3E\u5BF9\u65E9\u7ED3\u675F\u4E86\u3002"
    spanishLine: " Exactamente. La fiesta termin\xF3 hace mucho."
